law "|comparison distinguishes nonfinite values and rejects missing tensor values| is
  definition:
    closeSample NotANumber NotANumber 0 0 and
    not (closeSample PositiveInfinity NegativeInfinity 0 0) and
    not (closeSamples [] [Finite 1] 0 0) and
    not (closeSamples [Finite 1] [] 0 0) and
    closeSample (Finite 1) (Finite 1) 0 0
  end definition
end law
end unit
